WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
The hand rises and drops. A one-bar count-in from the table.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.500
The left palm rises. Colour floods the walls, note by note.

00:10.500 --> 00:17.000
Faster beats: every wall flashes faster.

00:17.000 --> 00:24.000
A fist. The walls go dark. One bell. A score for the take.
